    "result_text": "Both tests pass. Summary of the change:\n\n- **`openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a read-only `membershipTier` string property to the `OwnerDto` schema so the generated DTO gets a `setMembershipTier`.\n- **`MembershipTier.java`** (new) \u2014 a small cohesive helper mirroring the existing `NamesakeCount` pattern: returns `SILVER` when `namesakeCount == 0` and an email is present, otherwise `BRONZE`.\n- **`RespondWithOwner`** / **`RespondWithOwnerCreated`** \u2014 set the tier from the already-computed namesake count (one added line each; delegating to the helper keeps each responder at complexity 1).\n\nKept structural impact low: the tier logic lives in its own zero-context class rather than growing an existing one, and each touched function stays trivial. `Tests run: 2, Failures: 0, Errors: 0 \u2014 BUILD SUCCESS`.",
